 "lines": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "text": "Chapter ek. Game ka daam.",
   "end": 2.38
  },
  {
   "start": 2.38,
   "text": "PlayStation India pe do edition hain. Standard ₹5,999 , aur Ultimate ₹7,499 .",
   "end": 8.487
  },
  {
   "start": 9.053,
   "text": "Farak ₹1,500 ka. Aur us pandrah sau mein kya milta hai? Extra gaadiyan, hathiyaar, kapde aur safehouse business. Kahani wahi hai. Ek bhi extra mission wali story nahi.",
   "end": 19.7
  },
  {
   "start": 19.7,
   "text": "Dono edition ke saath Vintage Vice City pack aata hai. Aur jinhone 20 November se pehle digital pre-order kiya, unhe ek mahine ka GTA plus free mila. Ab khareedoge to wo free mahina nahi milega. Aur jinke paas hai, dhyaan rakhna: mahina khatam hote hi GTA plus apne aap renew hota hai, jab tak aap cancel na karo.",
   "end": 36.219
  },
  {
   "start": 36.49,
   "text": "Ab sabse mazedaar baat. Dukaan pe jo GTA six ka dabba milta hai, uske andar disc nahi hai. Sirf ek download code hai. Blinkit gyaarah shehron ke kuch ilaakon mein ye dabba minuton mein de raha hai, lekin khol ke milega code hi.",
   "end": 48.524
  },
  {
   "start": 48.855,
   "text": "Yaad rakhna, ye baat chapter do mein paise bachayegi.",
   "end": 51.222
  }
 ],
